  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1268288,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Relive the intensity of World War II in this classic arcade shooter, now brought to life on the Commodore Amiga! *1941* plunges you into the role of a daring American pilot battling against overwhelming odds in the Pacific Theater.  Defend against relentless waves of enemy aircraft and tanks as you navigate treacherous landscapes and bomb strategic targets. \n\nExperience the thrill of vertical scrolling gameplay, blasting your way through detailed environments rendered with an improved 2D engine.  Collect power-ups to enhance your firepower and unleash devastating attacks.  Face formidable bosses and uncover hidden secrets as you progress through challenging levels.  \n\n*1941* isn't just a nostalgic trip; it's a refined experience.  Expect enhanced graphics, smoother animation, and tighter controls, all optimized for the Amiga's capabilities.  Prepare for a relentless barrage of action and a true test of your piloting skills in this iconic shoot 'em up!"
    },
